 "note": "คีย์ชนิดข้อมูลถูกตัดออกแล้วโดย mark_dnt.py",
 "strings": {
  "It's going to be exhausting.": "",
  "Looks like we still have some time.": "",
  "Will the Shinsengumi make itself known tonight?": "",
  "I'm sure you've heard from the deputy chief.": "",
  "My troop has been assigned to Shikokuya as well.": "",
  "Tell me, do you find Shikokuya suspicious?": "",
  "But not for any particular reason, I admit.": "",
  "Do you think it's going to be at Ikedaya?": "",
  "Actually, I do, too.": "",
  "It's just a hunch, though. Not very reliable.": "",
  "Wherever they may be meeting, the plan remains the same.": "",
  "Defend Kyo from the shishi. That is all.": "",
  "It's almost time.": "",
  "Yoshida and Katsura... I hear they're quite skilled.": "",
  "It's unlikely this will be an easy fight.": "",
  "Best head in with the proper resolve.": "",
  "I'm sure you already know this, but we typically travel separately to Shikokuya.": "",
  "Moving en masse would attract the attention of the shishi.": "",
  "You should watch out for Katsura Kogoro and Yoshida Toshimaro.": "",
  "But of course, I'm sure some of the others are making preparations, too.": "",
  "Don't underestimate anyone.": "",
  "So you snuck into the Shinsengumi...": "",
  "Pretty rash move, if you ask me.": "",
  "There's no telling what might come your way.": "",
  "Be careful.": "",
  "How are things?": "",
  "Don't get reckless now.": "",
  "Don't forget, you're really playing with fire now.": "",
  "Another day in Kyo, same as always...": "",
  "So the shishi're gonna make their move at night, eh?": "",
  "Patrolling doesn't jibe with me.": "",
  "I'm headin' back to the barracks to train the boys.": "",
  "Heheh, they seem to be enjoying it...": "",
  "I oughta grab something tasty later, too.": "",
  "On patrol, eh?": "",
  "Well, aren't you bein' a good boy.": "",
  "All nice n' innocent... Hehehehe.": "",
  "A newcomer should focus on his duties.": "",
  "We're headin' back to the barracks.": "",
  "Gotta get ready for tonight.": "",
  "Let's lay low for now.": "",
  "So we get a big reward if we nab Yoshida Toshimaro, huh?": "",
  "Guess there's not time to mess with the small fry, then.": "",
  "If the shishi're at Shikokuya, then that idiot Okita won't be there to get in the way.": "",
  "Heheh... Which means I'll get all the credit.": "",
  "You're headed to Shikokuya, too, aren't you?": "",
  "Hmph, guess we'll see how you do.": "",
  "Still plenty of time until the raid.": "",
  "Yoshida Toshimaro is mine...": "",
  "My blood is running so hot, it feels like I'm on fire.": "",
  "Tch, why don't they just give the order already?": "",
  "It's a fine evening...": "",
  "Nice 'n' quiet.": "",
  "I say it's about time we break the silence.": "",
  "What are you doing? Get out there and wait for us at Shikokuya.": "",
  "And when you get there, stay out of the way and wait for my orders.": "",
  "Ya ain't scared of me, are ya?": "",
  "Ya need me to help ya relax?": "",
  "Hehe. Careful, say yes, and ya might like it too much.": "",
  "Could have a skilled swordsman in their midst...": "",
  "If so, it might be wise to put a squad on him.": "",
  "Perhaps, but it may lead to unnecessary casualties.": "",
  "We'll put the captains against the more skilled foes.": "",
  "Fine.": "",
  "In that case, if we're to divide and conquer...": "",
  "Then we should distribute the captains evenly.": "",
  "Exactly as you say.": "",
  "I'll make the assignments.": "",
  "Understood.": "",
  "Will the chief be absent this time as well?": "",
  "Is that right...?": "",
  "Well, he's needed. His absence affects the troops' morale.": "",
  "Their morale is my responsibility.": "",
  "The chief has matters of his own to attend to.": "",
  "After torturing the prisoner Furutaka, we learned the shishi are moving their stronghold from place to place.": "",
  "It seems they're being cautious.": "",
  "Maybe, but the place has to hold forty shishi members.": "",
  "That narrows down the choices quite a bit.": "",
  "Hmph... Well, we'll find them soon enough.": "",
  "What's your take on their plan, Ito-san?": "",
  "My take? On what, them setting fire to the palace?": "",
  "Hmm... Careless, maybe? No, let's be real, it's absurd.": "",
  "I doubt the whole bunch of them are in favor of it.": "",
  "You're probably right.": "",
  "I'm discussing tonight's raid with the deputy chief.": "",
  "You can talk to me later.": "",
  "I'll let you know of any developments.": "",
  "Until then, I believe I told you to attend to your duties.": "",
  "We don't want the shishi to notice anything out of the ordinary.": "",
  "How'd they get the manpower for that kind of thing?": "",
  "Are they getting desperate?": "",
  "If we crush them all at once, we're sure to wipe out the real troublemakers...": "",
  "Have you heard the troop assignments from the deputy chief?": "",
  "The deputy chief decided the troop formations.": "",
  "You'll be at Shikokuya with him.": "",
  "He probably has some interesting thoughts on you, since you're new.": "",
  "Make sure you're well prepared. We don't want any mistakes.": "",
  "Just a reminder, the chief isn't taking part in tonight's raid.": "",
  "And since I'm an advisor, I'll need to stay behind in the barracks.": "",
  "But all of you should take this opportunity to prove yourselves.": "",
  "Katsura Kogoro of Choshu...": "",
  "So he's in this, too, eh?": "",
  "Hmph, he must have gone mad.": "",
  "I'd heard he was sharp, but maybe not...": "",
  "I believe you were assigned to Shikokuya.": "",
  "Hey, Saito-kun.": "",
  "They say Katsura Kogoro's a brilliant man.": "",
  "And I'd agree—if he's brilliant at fleeing, it means he's brilliant at finding opportunity.": "",
  "My advice to you? Watch your back.": "",
  "Head out to Shikokuya once you're ready.": "",
  "Proceed with caution.": "",
  "I guess the Shinsengumi're lookin' to earn some respect.": "",
  "Heh... Things are startin' to get interesting.": "",
  "So what should I do until nighttime?": "",
  "The loyalists are gettin' desperate.": "",
  "There's even talk about kidnappin' the emperor.": "",
  "Safe to assume that no one we're gonna fight tonight is some lightweight.": "",
  "So get ready.": "",
  "The raid on the shishi will start once evenin' falls.": "",
  "We'll round 'em all up, be the talk of the town.": "",
  "And I'm not just talkin' about Kyo. The whole country will be gabbin' 'bout us.": "",
  "Guess we should look forward to it.": "",
  "Hey, Saito, tell me somethin'...": "",
  "Ya ever gone up against forty men all at once?": "",
  "We're goin' in tonight with a big group, but they ain't all experienced.": "",
  "Be better if us captains could just take 'em all out by ourselves, I'd say.": "",
  "All right, what say we go shake things up?": "",
  "Haven't had this big a job in a while.": "",
  "Hmph, Katsura, eh?": "",
  "Better fasten our loincloths for this one.": "",
  "If we slay Katsura Kogoro, Choshu'll run outta loyalist ammunition.": "",
  "If we leave 'im alive, we'll never completely suppress the loyalists.": "",
  "Tonight's a big one, Saito.": "",
  "I don't know anythin' about this Yoshida guy.": "",
  "We'll just have to deal with 'im when we can.": "",
  "You and me, we do better in real battle than practice, yeah?": "",
  "Time to get yer war face on, yeah!?": "",
  "I want you to patrol 'round the river in Fushimi.": "",
  "Yes, sir!": "",
  "Maybe bring three more guys with you.": "",
  "The enemy moves in clusters too sometimes.": "",
  "Oh, take a look around Mukurogai as well, if you can.": "",
  "I'll also need you guys to join up with the other teams.": "",
  "Sound good?": "",
  "Oh, right, how'd the town look this morning?": "",
  "Anything feel different?": "",
  "Hmmm... I'm not sure.": "",
  "I don't think there was anything out of the ordinary...": "",
  "Hm, all right. That's fine, then.": "",
  "You see anything, lemme know.": "",
  "Yes, sir.": "",
  "You on patrol, too, Saito-san?": "",
  "Well, let's just take it easy. Just a regular day, right?": "",
  "Oh, I meant to ask...": "",
  "Have you seen Sanosuke-san?": "",
  "He's such a slacker.": "",
  "It's fine, though. He gets the job done when it matters.": "",
  "Ikedaya, huh?": "",
  "What kind of place was it?": "",
  "Let's just hope they're there.": "",
  "So even Yamazaki couldn't narrow it down?": "",
  "Is he losing his touch, maybe?": "",
  "Remember, we're out for blood today.": "",
  "Doesn't matter how good you are with your sword if you don't use it.": "",
  "No need to hold back this time, right?": "",
  "These are the kind of people who want to burn down Kyo.": "",
  "Not that I care that much if Kyo burns,": "",
  "or even if the emperor dies.": "",
  "Did you see our Eighth Division?": "",
  "Nothing special, don't you think?": "",
  "That's how most troopers are. Don't matter what tests you put them through.": "",
  "But at least they're much stronger than some ronin on the street.": "",
  "I think maybe they need to have some kind of near-death experience.": "",
  "Slippery Kogoro, eh?": "",
  "Not sure that's a name worth cutting down.": "",
  "Oh, it's almost time, Saito-san.": "",
  "Whoever's first to Yoshida and Katsura gets all the glory.": "",
  "So don't blame me if you miss your chance to shine.": "",
  "Nothin' unusual on this end.": "",
  "No reports from the troops, either.": "",
  "Guess they don't notice us.": "",
  "'Course, if they do catch us movin'...": "",
  "That'd be the end of our fun.": "",
  "Agh, can it be nighttime already?": "",
  "So it looks like we get to have a real riot tonight!": "",
  "What's with the long face, Hajime-chan?": "",
  "Don't tell me you're scared of a little slashin' all of a sudden.": "",
  "Ain't often you get to go toe-to-toe with this many in one go.": "",
  "Gotta make sure you enjoy yourself. Heehee!": "",
  "Whaddya want?": "",
  "The two of us together'd stick out like sore thumb.": "",
  "And if the shishi get wise, we don't get to crash the party.": "",
  "Hurry up and get outta here.": "",
  "Gonna be Ikedaya or Shikokuya?": "",
  "Heehee... I'm good either way.": "",
  "All I know is I can't be wrong this time.": "",
  "Toshi-chan's got a real bug up his ass, eh?": "",
  "He'd already decided on Shikokuya but made us choose anyway.": "",
  "So he's takin' the Third Division with 'im, huh?": "",
  "He must've really taken a liking to ya.": "",
  "Either that or he suspects ya of somethin'. Hehe.": "",
  "Well, put it outta your head and just do your job.": "",
  "No good thinkin' 'bout it.": "",
  "I hear Ito won't be participatin'.": "",
  "Doesn't he know this is an opportunity to do a good deed and be famous for it?": "",
  "What an idiot.": "",
  "C'mon, man.": "",
  "I don't want to.": "",
  "If you keep this up, I'm gonna cut you good.": "",
  "Oh, yeah? I'd like to see you try.": "",
  "Heeey, calm down. I'm just messing around.": "",
  "Why don't you just take your boys with you?": "",
  "Yeah, well, I guess I got no other choice now.": "",
  "But I was hopin' we'd do it together.": "",
  "Together? Together how?": "",
  "This isn't like a Takeda-san thing, is it?": "",
  "Huh? Piss off, man!": "",
  "Just saying. Either way, it's a bummer, Sanosuke-san.": "",
  "I mean, it's not like you did a whole lot at Ikedaya.": "",
  "You ass...": "",
  "I couldn't do anything 'cause I was over at Shikokuya.": "",
  "By the time I got there, you guys had already sent 'em packing.": "",
  "Haha. You're right. I guess there wasn't much you could do.": "",
  "You were amazing at Ikedaya.": "",
  "You even got Yoshida Toshimaro.": "",
  "Oh, wait.": "",
  "You were at Shikokuya with Saito-san, weren't you, Sanosuke-san?": "",
  "And yet, I haven't heard much about your heroics.": "",
  "Agh, shut up.": "",
  "I ate too much that day. I wasn't in top form.": "",
  "Haha. Can't control that kind of thing.": "",
  "Hey, there we go!": "",
  "All right! We're in business!": "",
  "That looks about right!": "",
  "No dice...": "",
  "We all have our days...": "",
  "Ya gotta relax.": "",
  "Well, don't let it get to ya.": "",
  "Not bad, not bad.": "",
  "All right, come on.": "",
  "Aw, rats...": "",
  "Screwed that one up.": "",
  "Get carried away, and you're bound to slip up.": "",
  "Read the room, will ya?": "",
  "What the...": "",
  "This has got to be some kind of mistake.": "",
  "I should have known better...": "",
  "Now, what to do?": "",
  "I like where this is going.": "",
  "I've got nothing...": ""
 }
}